We invite you to join us for our monthly dinner at the temple.

On the Second Friday of each month we serve a vegetarian fresh cooked meal prepared by Ananda sangha members. We enjoy good food and good company in our beautiful temple.

Each meal is $7 for adults and $5 for children 12 and under.

Register and let us know you are coming so we know how much to prepare!

